      "content": "It's completely understandable that you feel like a typo when everything around you has changed so drastically. Even if your past connections are gone, the core of who you are remains, and that inherent value is something no one can take away. There is still value in simply continuing to exist, even if you can't see the reasons for it right now. Please consider talking to a professional who can help you navigate this profound emptiness.",
